<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SweetCustom | Custom Cake Bakery</title>
    
    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->
    <script src="https://github.com/Wdjjmr/WEB-Made-By-Kenlys.git"></script>
    
    <!-- Google Fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        'cake-pink': '#FDF2F8',
                        'cake-rose': '#F43F5E',
                        'cake-brown': '#451A03',
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        'serif': ['Playfair Display', 'serif'],
                        'sans': ['Poppins', 'sans-serif'],
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
</head>
<body class="font-sans text-cake-brown bg-[#fffafc] antialiased">

    <!-- 1. Sticky Navbar -->
    <nav class="bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md fixed w-full top-0 z-50 shadow-sm border-b border-cake-pink">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center h-20">
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center cursor-pointer">
                    <h1 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-cake-rose tracking-wide">SweetCustom</h1>
                </div>
                <div class="hidden md:flex space-x-8 items-center">
                    <a href="#home" class="text-cake-brown hover:text-cake-rose font-medium transition-colors">Beranda</a>
                    <a href="#portfolio" class="text-cake-brown hover:text-cake-rose font-medium transition-colors">Portofolio</a>
                    <a href="#cara-pesan" class="text-cake-brown hover:text-cake-rose font-medium transition-colors">Cara Pesan</a>
                    <a href="#kontak" class="bg-cake-rose text-white px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-rose-600 transition-all shadow-md shadow-rose-200">Hubungi Kami</a>
                </div>
                <!-- Mobile menu button -->
                <div class="md:hidden flex items-center">
                    <button class="text-cake-brown hover:text-cake-rose">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16"></path></svg>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- 2. Hero Section -->
    <section id="home" class="pt-32 pb-20 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 lg:gap-20">
        <div class="md:w-1/2 space-y-6 text-center md:text-left mt-8 md:mt-0">
            <span class="inline-block py-1 px-4 rounded-full bg-cake-pink text-cake-rose text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide border border-rose-100">
                Artisan Bakery
            </span>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold leading-tight text-cake-brown">
                Kreasikan Momen Manismu dengan <span class="text-cake-rose">Kue Custom</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed">
                Setiap perayaan berhak mendapatkan kue yang spesial. Kami merancang dan memanggang kue sesuai dengan impian dan desain Anda sendiri dengan bahan premium.
            </p>
            <div class="pt-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center md:justify-start">
                <a href="#portfolio" class="inline-block bg-cake-brown text-white px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-[#2d1102] transition-all shadow-lg text-center">Lihat Karya Kami</a>
                <a href="#cara-pesan" class="inline-block bg-white text-cake-brown border border-cake-brown px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-cake-pink transition-all text-center">Cara Pesan</a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="md:w-1/2 w-full relative">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cake-pink rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50 transform translate-x-10 translate-y-10"></div>
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1562777717-b6c3b6d0800b?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Beautiful Custom Cake" class="relative rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-8 border-white object-cover h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] w-full z-10">
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. Portfolio Section -->
    <section id="portfolio" class="py-24 bg-white relative">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h3 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-cake-brown">Portofolio Kami</h3>
                <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-cake-rose mx-auto rounded-full mb-6"></div>
                <p class="text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-light text-lg">Beberapa desain kue kustom yang pernah kami buat. Desain mana yang menginspirasi perayaan Anda?</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                <!-- Portfolio 1 -->
                <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-md cursor-pointer border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
                    <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1557925923-33b251d59084?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Kue Pernikahan" class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-700 ease-in-out">
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-cake-brown/90 via-cake-brown/40 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-300 flex flex-col justify-end p-6">
                        <h4 class="text-white font-serif text-2xl font-bold mb-1 transform translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition duration-300">Kue Pernikahan</h4>
                        <p class="text-cake-pink text-sm transform translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition duration-300 delay-75">Fondant & Sugar Flowers</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Portfolio 2 -->
                <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-md cursor-pointer border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
                    <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558961363-fa8fdf82db35?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Kue Ulang Tahun Anak" class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-700 ease-in-out">
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-cake-brown/90 via-cake-brown/40 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-300 flex flex-col justify-end p-6">
                        <h4 class="text-white font-serif text-2xl font-bold mb-1 transform translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition duration-300">Kue Ulang Tahun Anak</h4>
                        <p class="text-cake-pink text-sm transform translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition duration-300 delay-75">Buttercream & Macarons</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Portfolio 3 -->
                <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-md cursor-pointer border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
                    <div class="aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
                        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621303837174-89787a7d4729?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Anniversary Cake" class="w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition duration-700 ease-in-out">
                    </div>
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-cake-brown/90 via-cake-brown/40 to-transparent opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition duration-300 flex flex-col justify-end p-6">
                        <h4 class="text-white font-serif text-2xl font-bold mb-1 transform translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition duration-300">Anniversary Cake</h4>
                        <p class="text-cake-pink text-sm transform translate-y-4 group-hover:translate-y-0 transition duration-300 delay-75">Minimalist & Gold Accents</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-12 text-center">
                <button class="text-cake-rose font-medium hover:text-rose-700 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto gap-2 transition-colors">
                    Lihat Lebih Banyak Karya Kami
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path></svg>
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. Cara Pesan Section -->
    <section id="cara-pesan" class="py-24 bg-cake-pink/40">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <h3 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold text-cake-brown mb-4">Cara Pemesanan</h3>
                <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-cake-rose mx-auto rounded-full"></div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 md:gap-4 relative">
                <!-- Garis Penghubung (Hanya Desktop) -->
                <div class="hidden md:block absolute top-10 left-1/8 right-1/8 h-0.5 bg-rose-200 z-0"></div>
                
                <!-- Langkah 1 -->
                <div class="space-y-4 text-center relative z-10">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg text-cake-rose text-3xl font-serif font-bold border-4 border-cake-pink">1</div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-xl text-cake-brown">Konsultasi Desain</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm px-2">Kirim referensi foto atau ide kue yang Anda inginkan via chat.</p>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Langkah 2 -->
                <div class="space-y-4 text-center relative z-10">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg text-cake-rose text-3xl font-serif font-bold border-4 border-cake-pink">2</div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-xl text-cake-brown">Pilih Rasa & Ukuran</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm px-2">Tentukan rasa favorit dan ukuran yang sesuai untuk acara.</p>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Langkah 3 -->
                <div class="space-y-4 text-center relative z-10">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg text-cake-rose text-3xl font-serif font-bold border-4 border-cake-pink">3</div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-xl text-cake-brown">Pembayaran (DP)</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm px-2">Lakukan konfirmasi pesanan dengan memberikan uang muka.</p>
                </div>
                
                <!-- Langkah 4 -->
                <div class="space-y-4 text-center relative z-10">
                    <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto shadow-lg text-cake-rose text-3xl font-serif font-bold border-4 border-cake-pink">4</div>
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-xl text-cake-brown">Kue Dikirim</h4>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm px-2">Kue siap dinikmati dan dikirimkan dengan aman ke lokasi.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 5. Footer / Kontak via WhatsApp -->
    <footer id="kontak" class="bg-cake-brown text-white pt-20 pb-10">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center space-y-8">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold">Siap Memesan Kue Spesial Anda?</h3>
            <p class="text-cake-pink/80 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto font-light">
                Saat ini kami melayani pemesanan langsung melalui WhatsApp untuk mendiskusikan detail desain secara lebih personal dan akurat.
            </p>
            
            <div class="pt-6 pb-12">
                <a href="https://wa.me/6281234567890" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#25D366] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-[#20bd5a] hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-xl shadow-green-900/50">
                    <!-- WhatsApp Icon SVG -->
                    <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.298-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.298-.497.099-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51a12.8 12.8 0 0 0-.57-.01c-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.095 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 0 1-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 0 1-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 0 1 2.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0 0 12.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 0 0 5.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 0 0-3.48-8.413Z"/></svg>
                    Pesan via WhatsApp
                </a>
            </div>
